# Meeting-to-Action Bot for Student Teams

An AI-powered automation project that converts meeting transcripts into structured summaries, action items, owners, deadlines, and team notifications.

## Features

- Telegram bot for transcript submission
- AI-powered meeting analysis with a deterministic fallback mode
- Task extraction with owner and deadline detection
- Google Sheets or Trello integration-ready exports
- n8n workflow blueprint for automation
- Example transcript and sample output

